[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9782.71, "timestamp": "02:43:02", "text": "ちなみに、返金は一切できません。この購入は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9785.59, "timestamp": "02:43:05", "text": "ファイナル。ああ、なんてひどい詐欺だ。推測"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9787.75, "timestamp": "02:43:07", "text": "待ちます。私たちに選択肢はない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9792.389, "timestamp": "02:43:12", "text": "ジーンに伝えに行こう。弾薬袋。わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9794.469, "timestamp": "02:43:14", "text": "銃はあと1丁残っている。黄色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9797.63, "timestamp": "02:43:17", "text": "銃ですよね？つまり、これは赤色です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9800.51, "timestamp": "02:43:20", "text": "ぎゅっとする。これは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9802.19, "timestamp": "02:43:22", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9810.309, "timestamp": "02:43:30", "text": "ガス。グープは最悪だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9812.79, "timestamp": "02:43:32", "text": "お父さん、早く帰ってもいい？買います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9816.06, "timestamp": "02:43:36", "text": "まさにその通り。警官たち。わからない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9818.23, "timestamp": "02:43:38", "text": "[拍手]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9820.55, "timestamp": "02:43:40", "text": "吸引モード。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9838.16, "timestamp": "02:43:58", "text": "袋。私もこのMODを購入したいです。"}]